<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106583" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλαῖος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>belonging to
				the wood</i> or <i>forest, savage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					23.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					16.10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθοσύνη,</span> i.e. weeds, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				11.365
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>):—<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὑλαία</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑλᾰγωγ-αίη</span></b> , ἡ, <i>a wild</i> district on the
			Borysthenes, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>material, corporeal,</i> Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				p.114B.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>concerned with matter,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					5.14
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				134
			</span></i>; <i>belonging to</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλη,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπύριος</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰθέριος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Theol.Plat.</u>
				4.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
